00:15:28.990 --> 00:15:32.740
Help us think of ways to 
make the concert a success.

00:15:32.740 --> 00:15:34.030
Wait a minute.

00:15:34.030 --> 00:15:36.080
This is all too sudden.

00:15:36.530 --> 00:15:39.720
We're going to need all kinds 
of equipment for a concert.

00:15:39.720 --> 00:15:41.790
Besides, can you guys even...

