00:16:11.640 --> 00:16:13.450
I'll try my best.

00:16:13.790 --> 00:16:15.200
Ready, and...

00:16:30.550 --> 00:16:33.260
Please be careful on the stairs.

00:16:33.260 --> 00:16:34.550
