but if there's any hope for us,

00:19:01.640 --> 00:19:03.870
we'd appreciate your cooperation.

00:20:54.380 --> 00:20:56.520
Wh-What did you think?

00:20:57.700 --> 00:20:59.360
It was great.

00:20:59.360 --> 00:21:01.230
R-Really?

00:21:02.370 --> 00:21:03.530
Yeah.

00:21:04.630 --> 00:21:06.080
Thank goodness.

00:21:06.080 --> 00:21:11.490
HibikiP-san, I mean, Kyo-san liked it.

00:21:13.000 --> 00:21:15.460
Not that I'm surprised.

00:21:15.850 --> 00:21:18.330
Will you help us, then?

00:21:18.330 --> 00:21:21.450
For a concert around the end of May.

00:21:21.450 --> 00:21:23.090
